- `GET /api/schedules` (rateLimit('read')) -- return all schedules
- `PUT /api/schedules/:id` (rateLimit('write')) -- update schedule, restart job if cron/enabled changed
- `DELETE /api/schedules/:id` (rateLimit('write')) -- stop job, remove from file

